:: bed
<img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="centerHouse" />

<hr>

<<if $player.sleeping>>\
	As the sun reveals the world to a nice Monday morning, you climb out of bed, ready to start a new day. <<- either("The birds chip happily in the morning sun and the trees rustle alive in the early breeze.", "The morning sun shines through your room, illuminating it in a nice warm glow.")>>
	<<set $player.sleeping to false>>\
<<else>>\
	You currently stand in the middle of your cozy small bedroom.
<</if>>\
<<unlessLateToJob>>\
    <<keyOption "Leave your room" main 🚪>>\
    /*<<keyOption "Manage room" bedManager 🛌>>*/
    <<keyOption "Watch porn" watchPorn 💗>>: 30min
<</unlessLateToJob>>\
:: main
<img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," class="centerHouse" />

<hr>

You are currently standing in the middle of the main room of your house.
	
''Is there something you want to do in here?''
<<unlessLateToJob>>\
    <<keyOption "Watch TV" watchTv 📺>>: 30min
    <<include workOption>>\
    <<keyOption "Go outside" home 🚪>>
    <<keyOption "The Basement" basement 🔒>>
    <<keyOption "Your Bedroom" bed 🛌>>
<</unlessLateToJob>>\
:: watchTv
<<addMinutes 30>>\
@@color:yellow;You spend the next half hour skimming through channels and shows.@@
<<include main>>\
:: watchPorn
<<addMinutes 30>>\
@@color:yellow;You spend the next half hour skimming through porn and jerking off.@@
<<include bed>>\
:: basement
<img class="centerHouse" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,">

<hr>

You are currently on your basement.
<<if $slaves.length > 0>>\

    Slaves:
    <<for _slave range $slaves>>\
        _slave.name (_slave.age y.o. _slave.hairColor hair)
    <</for>>\
<</if>>\

<<unlessLateToJob>>\
    <<keyOption "Go back upstairs" main 🚪>>
    <<include workOption>>\
<</unlessLateToJob>>\